{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Linked Unsupervised Feature Selection.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Linked Unsupervised Feature Selection.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"linked unsupervised feature selection linked unsupervised feature selection","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Linked Unsupervised Feature Selection.md","fileName":"Linked Unsupervised Feature Selection.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Linked Unsupervised Feature Selection","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 21:34\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Unsupervised Feature Selection for Clustering]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Unsupervised Feature Selection for Clustering","dataclustering.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Linked Unsupervised Feature Selection.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Linked Unsupervised Feature Selection.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"linked unsupervised feature selection linked unsupervised feature selection","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Linked Unsupervised Feature Selection.md","fileName":"Linked Unsupervised Feature Selection.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Linked Unsupervised Feature Selection","heading":"Linked Unsupervised Feature Selection","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Linked unsupervised feature selection couples feature choice to both local data geometry and the global cluster structure inferred from that geometry. Rather than completing selection and clustering as isolated stages, it lets each refine the other.\n\nThe link can improve consistency between representation and partition, especially when labels are absent. It also creates a nonconvex joint problem whose outcome may depend on initialization, graph construction, and the relative weight placed on selection versus clustering.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Un